{
  "title": "Q1 Board Report - Public",
  "body": {
    "content": [
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "TITLE",
          "text": "Q1 Board Report - Public"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Prepared for: Partners\nDate: March 15, 2026"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Executive Summary"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Q1 2026 was a strong quarter with 32% year-over-year revenue growth. We exceeded targets in both enterprise sales and product adoption."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Revenue Overview"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Total revenue for Q1 reached $12.4M, up from $9.4M in Q1 2025. Enterprise contracts accounted for 68% of total revenue. Organic growth alone puts us ahead of plan."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Customer Growth"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "We added 47 new enterprise customers this quarter, bringing our total to 248. Net retention rate is 118%. New customers came through direct sales and channel partners."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Product Updates"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "We launched three major features: real-time collaboration, advanced analytics dashboard, and API v2.0. User engagement increased 25%. We have exciting initiatives in the pipeline for the second half of the year."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Engineering Metrics"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Team grew from 85 to 102 engineers. Sprint velocity increased 15%. System uptime maintained at 99.95%."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Market Position"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "According to Gartner, we moved from Niche Player to Visionary in the Magic Quadrant. Our NPS score improved from 42 to 58."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Sales Pipeline"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Current pipeline value is $28M with expected close rate of 35%. Three deals over $1M are in late-stage negotiations."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Hiring Plan"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "We plan to hire 30 additional engineers and 15 sales reps in Q2. Three VP-level searches are underway."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Financial Outlook"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "We project Q2 revenue of $14.2M based on current pipeline. Full-year target remains $55M."
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "heading": "HEADING_1",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      },
      {
        "paragraph": {
          "text": "Q1 demonstrated strong execution across all functions. We are well-positioned for continued growth in Q2."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
ENDOFDOC

